window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Elara, rescued from Lord Blackwood's dungeon finds freedom at the hands of her childhood sweetheart, Silvan. Years have passed since they last saw each other, and Elara grapples with a newfound truth: her love for Silvan has never faded. Facing years of captivity at the hands of Lord Bloodrose due to an elven binding that holds her magic to his will, she struggles with the renewed connection.</p> <p>The long journey is riddled with temptations, new friendships, and a mysterious dark force that tempts Elara with a different path, a path that promises power and vengeance. Torn between love and vengeance, Elara must choose between the light she once knew and the darkness that beckons.</p>"; 
